  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Get a grip with this sleek, reusable silicone suction pad designed for smartphones. Featuring 24 strong mini suction cups, this compact accessory offers a secure hold on smooth surfaces—ideal for mounting your phone to mirrors, windows, tiles, or dashboards. The pad sticks without residue and detaches easily, making it perfect for hands-free calls, selfies, or video watching. Compact, lightweight, and travel-friendly, it adds convenience without bulk.",
  "description_html": "<p>Get a grip with this sleek, reusable silicone suction pad designed for smartphones. Featuring 24 strong mini suction cups, this compact accessory offers a secure hold on smooth surfaces—ideal for mounting your phone to mirrors, windows, tiles, or dashboards. The pad sticks without residue and detaches easily, making it perfect for hands-free calls, selfies, or video watching. Compact, lightweight, and travel-friendly, it adds convenience without bulk.</p>"
